  m_text: '

    High atop the mountain, Count Dracula''s castle loomed over the
    land. For centuries, its shadow brought tyranny and endless bloodshed. In the
    end, the elders of the High Families abandoned the path of open warfare and devised
    a silent plan to end the nightmare once and for all.'
