  m_text: '

    Unaware of the trap, the Count set his eyes on Lenore, a young woman
    of captivating beauty. Deploying his ancestral manipulation, the vampire lured
    her into the castle''s halls, oblivious to the fact that she was the centerpiece
    of the conspiracy.'
